"pk",]),(["time":908963653,"author":"天才小衣衣(chan)","msg":"force_gain=kee_cost*(me->query(\"max_force\")+me->query(\"con\")*2)/2000;if(me->query(\"class\")==\"fighter\") force_gain=force_gain*1.5;// 98/6/4 ppl 反应以这种方法无法增加max_force//经检查结果 swordsman force lv 50 ,max_force ==250, kee 166//如果一次exercise kee 160 ,force_gain~=160(250+40)/2000=23 难怪有人叫swordsman去死//这种情况想不出怎么解决....其它force低的class大概也一样//不过我和chan认为不要让ppl知道有改exercise...不然系统大乱,tintin开始出现//so 我先加上这行,然后再进行讨论解决的方法....:) ...Rogerif(me->query(\"class\")==\"swordsman\" || me->query(\"class\")==\"poisoner\"|| me->query(\"class\")==\"taoist\" || me->query(\"class\")==\"dancer\")force_gain=force_gain*1.2; //这是因为 lv 50 下 max_force only 250                          //这样一来若一次运完所有kee,force_gain~=46                            //奇怪又被改了...太扯了....我修正回来:by chan        // 请问这可能吗?  ask by wade..这部份..后来证明没有意义......所以我/* */掉了","title":"有关exercise d l的部份",]),(["time":909019007,"author":"天才小衣衣(chan)","msg":"       return notify_fail(\"你只能用内功\\\调理自己的气息。\\n\");if((int)me->query(\"force\")<20)        return notify_fail(\"你的内力不够。\\n\");me->receive_heal(\"kee\",(int)me->query(\"max_force\")/7);//原本是me->receive_heal(\"kee\",实在(int)me有点->qu扯ery(\"force\")/5);        message_vision(\"$N深深吸了几口气，脸色看起来好多了。\\n\",me);me->add(\"force\", -20);// 因为 recover 和 exercise 可以互换// 当 force level 大于一定值,recover 合 exercise 互换会kee,force 皆越换越多// 故以上限简查来中止互换练功\我查一下之前的file..发现..这有被改过....所以...ccccc修正并调整其严格性...","title":"recover",]),(["time":909019171,"author":"天才小衣衣(chan)","msg":"if(me->query(\"class\")==\"fighter\") force_gain=force_gain*1.2;//原来的if(me->query(\"class\")==\"fighter\") force_gain=force_gain*1.5;","title":"exercise.c",]),(["time":909022138,"author":"天才小衣衣(chan)","msg":"/*me->receive_heal(\"kee\",(int)me->query(\"max_force\")/7);//原本是me->receive_heal(\"kee\",实在(int)me有点->qu扯ery(\"force\")/5);*/   value=(int)me->query(\"max_force\")/5;  if(value<50) //保障新手条款   value=50;  if(value>300) //设定上限   value=300;me->receive_heal(\"kee\",value);新的recover...的修正","title":"recover",]),(["time":909023391,"author":"天才小衣衣(chan)","msg":"同样做修正.....       if( target != me ) return notify_fail(\"你只能用内功\\\收歛自己的心神。\\n\");        if( (int)me->query(\"force\") < 20 )                return notify_fail(\"你的内力不够。\\n\");    value=(int)me->query(\"max_force\")/10;     if(value>100)      value=100; me->receive_heal(\"sen\",value);//以上fix  by chan        me->add(\"force\", -20);        message_vision(\"$N略一凝神，吸了口气，精神看起来清醒多了。\\n\", me);        if( me->is_fighting() ) me->start_busy(1);        return 1;   if( (int)me->query(\"force\") < 20 ):        return notify_fail(\"你的内力不够。\\n\");::    me->receive_heal(\"gin\",(int)me->query(\"force\")/5);:c   value=(int)me->query(\"max_force\")/10;     if(value>100)      value=100;me->receive_heal(\"gin\",value);//以上修正by chan","title":"regenerate及refersh.c",]),(["time":909081526,"author":"小雪球(babe)","msg":"who.c  将 to list clan name 修正..cname.c  原来限制字数的地方错了..  是无限制..  我将字数新限定为 7 字..nick.c  将字数限定为 10 字..字数是以全型字计算..为了 who.c 请 title , name , nick , 不要太长.. :)字数若要再调整.. 请麻烦再去更动吧..不要太长就好.. :P--[1;34m╔═══╗╔═══╗╔═══╗╔═══╗[1;34m║      ║║      ║║      ║║      ║[1;36m║      ║║      ║║      ║║      ║[1;36m║   ═ ║║   ═ ║║   ═ ║║    ═╣[1;37m║   ═ ║║  ╔╗║║   ═ ║║    ═╣[1;37m╚═══╝╚═╝╚╝╚═══╝╚═══╝[0m","title":"修改一些 cmds",]),(["time":909250631,"author":"亚瑟(arthur)","msg":"	/open/gblade/npc/yuan.c	加一行 void do_surrender();	在 31 行的 (: \"do_surrender\" :)	改成 (: do_surrender :)	","title":"yuan.c",]),(["time":909301358,"author":"亚瑟(arthur)","msg":"/daemon/class/taoist/necromancy/npc:	hugegod.c : leave() 中的 message_vision 前		加上 if( environment() )	fox : 同上/daemon/class/taoist/necromancy:	feeblebolt.c : remove_effect 将 me->set_temp(\"tt\",0); 往前调		以免施法不会结束/open/gblade/mob/test24.c :	carry_object...... 那个东西的路径是 /u 下的, 可能已经	不存在了, 所以 mark 起来.../daemon/class/taoist/necromancy/invocation.c :	在 filename 那边加一个 if( f